  - SpeakerName: Guild Captain
    DialogueText: Brace yourselves! The Demon Lord approaches! Do not let them breach
      the gates!
    PortraitLeft: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitMiddle: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitRight: {fileID: 0}
    Background: {fileID: 0}
    Focus: 0
    BackgroundOverlay: 0
    EventID: 
    VoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - SpeakerName: Lilith
    DialogueText: Gates? They think wood and stone can stop the Master of Gehenna?
